    "Run AI prompts automatically on a schedule.": "按计划自动运行 AI 提示词。",
    "Run the Accessibility Helper Elevated": "以提权方式运行辅助功能助手",
    "Save AI-generated custom keywords": "存储 AI 生成的自定义关键词",
    "Say this word at the end of a dictation to submit. It is removed from the pasted text.": "在听写末尾说出该词即可提交，它不会出现在粘贴的文本中。",
    "Scan a short-lived QR code in Raycast for iPhone to connect it to this computer.": "在 Raycast for iPhone 中扫描短期有效的二维码，将其连接到这台电脑。",
    "Scheduled Backup": "定时备份",
    "Screenshots in these folders will be indexed.": "这些文件夹中的截屏将被索引。",
    "Search sensitivity controls the number of matching results presented in Root Search. Low sensitivity produces many results for a search term, while high sensitivity displays fewer results.": "搜索灵敏度控制根搜索中呈现的匹配结果数量。低灵敏度会为一个搜索词给出较多结果，高灵敏度则显示较少结果。",
    "See which content categories are synced across devices.": "查看哪些内容类别会在设备之间同步。",
    "Select the provider used to fetch favicons or None to disable favicon fetching.": "选择获取网站图标的来源，选择「无」可停用图标获取。",
    "Setting a short storage duration will automatically remove olders screenshots. Pinned screenshots will not be deleted.": "设置较短的存储时长会自动移除较旧的截屏。已置顶的截屏不会被删除。",
    "Shell": "Shell",
    "Shortcut for sending messages in Quick AI and AI Chat.": "在快速 AI 和 AI 对话中发送消息的快捷键。",
    "Show Link Previews": "显示链接预览",
    "Show Warning Before Deleting Quicklinks": "删除快速链接前显示警告",
    "Show a system notification when a chat finishes in the background.": "对话在后台完成时显示系统通知。",
    "Show conversations from AI Chat and Quick AI combined or keep them separate.": "把 AI 对话和快速 AI 的对话合并显示，或分开显示。",
    "Skip on Battery": "使用电池时跳过",
    "Skip scheduled exports while on battery power and run them once back on AC power.": "使用电池供电时跳过定时导出，接上电源后再补跑一次。",
    "Slack Community": "Slack 社区",
    "Snooze Duration": "暂停时长",
    "Start a new chat after the set time when opening Quick AI or AI Chat.": "打开快速 AI 或 AI 对话时，在设定时长后开启新对话。",
    "Storage Duration": "存储时长",
    "Styles control how dictated text is processed by AI.": "样式决定 AI 如何处理听写文本。",
    "Subscription": "订阅",
    "Target rendering updates at around 60 FPS. Disabled by default in Raycast (WebKit enables it by default). Requires restarting Raycast.": "将渲染更新目标设为约 60 FPS。Raycast 中默认关闭（WebKit 默认开启）。需要重启 Raycast。",
    "Text content in screenshots will be automatically extracted and can be searched.": "截屏中的文字内容会被自动提取，并可被搜索。",
    "The key pressed to submit.": "用于提交的按键。",
    "The name shown when choosing this computer on iPhone.": "在 iPhone 上选择这台电脑时显示的名称。",
    "Tidy Menu Bar": "整理菜单栏",
    "Tools that run without approval in every chat. Per-chat approvals stay with their chat.": "在所有对话中无需批准即可运行的工具。按对话授予的批准仍绑定在该对话内。",
    "Tune advanced behavior, exporting, and connectivity.": "调整高级行为、导出与连接性。",
    "Turn plain language into actions and answers with extensions.": "用扩展把自然语言转化为操作与答案。",
    "Uninstall NTFS Scanner": "卸载 NTFS 扫描器",
    "Uninstall the NTFS Scanner service and stop it from running.": "卸载 NTFS 扫描器服务并停止其运行。",
    "Use NTFS Scanner": "使用 NTFS 扫描器",
    "Use Palette for Snippet Expansion": "使用 Palette 展开片段",
    "Use a scanner based on the NTFS Master File Table. May speed up indexing on systems with large HDDs. Requires User Account Control (UAC) permissions.": "使用基于 NTFS 主文件表的扫描器。在配备大容量机械硬盘的系统上可加快索引。需要用户账户控制（UAC）权限。",
    "Use context from your frontmost app to improve transcription accuracy. It stays private and isn't stored.": "利用当前应用的上下文提升转写准确度。这些内容保持私密，不会被存储。",
    "Use ignore files": "使用忽略文件",
    "Use separate processes to release each window's memory independently, or share one process across windows. Requires restarting Raycast.": "使用独立进程以便单独释放每个窗口的内存，或让多个窗口共用一个进程。需要重启 Raycast。",
    "View devices connected to Cloud Sync.": "查看已连接到云同步的设备。",
    "Website": "网站",
    "When enabled (experimental), Raycast expands Snippets before System Snippets. When disabled (default), matching Snippets won't expand.": "开启后（实验性），Raycast 会先于系统文本替换展开片段。关闭时（默认），匹配的片段不会展开。",
    "When enabled, Raycast will automatically pass selected text from the active application to Quicklinks with a single argument when invoked via hotkey.": "开启后，通过热键调用时，Raycast 会自动把当前应用中的选中文本作为单一参数传给快速链接。",
    "When enabled, all images and videos in the screenshot folders will be indexed, not just screenshots.": "开启后，截屏文件夹中的所有图片和视频都会被索引，而不只是截屏。",
    "When enabled, text recognition will download cloud-only files (e.g., OneDrive, Dropbox) to extract text.": "开启后，文字识别会下载仅存于云端的文件（如 OneDrive、Dropbox）以提取文本。",
    "When enabled, your search term is stored as a custom keyword on the emoji you copied or pasted, helping future searches find it without AI.": "开启后，你的搜索词会被存为你复制或粘贴的表情符号的自定义关键词，便于日后不依赖 AI 也能搜到。",
    "When opening a Quicklink, check if the URL is already open and activate that tab instead of opening a new one.": "打开快速链接时，先检查该链接是否已经打开，并激活对应标签页而不是新开一个。",
    "Window Activation Behavior": "窗口激活行为",
    "Words and names that dictation should always get right.": "听写应当始终正确识别的词语和名称。",
    "Speech to text anywhere": "随时随地语音转文字",
    "Keep using Dictation": "继续使用听写",
